###01 POST Create  Product
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/products
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Camara&
price=100

###02 GET Find Products Page
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/products?page=1&limit=10


###03 GET Find Products Page By ID
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/products/1

###04 PATCH actualizar producto
PATCH localhost:{{port}}/products/5
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Camara Lenovo&
price=150

###05 Delete eliminar producto
DELETE localhost:{{port}}/products/5
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
